Original change's description:
> [maps] Fully initialize relevant fields before publishing maps
>
> Ensure concurrent compiler threads cannot observe maps with unupdated
> unused_property_fields or inconsistent construction_counter values:
> - Account for added property fields before connecting transitions in
>   Map::CopyAddDescriptor and Map::ShareDescriptor.
> - Initialize in-object slack tracking before publishing initial maps on
>   JSFunctions.
> - Avoid zeroing construction_counter before CompleteInobjectSlackTracking
>   acquires map_updater_access.
>
> Fixed: 574351803
>
